            "detailed_description": "In a flooded future world rife with violence, rumors of killer machines have spread far and wide. As a number of factions emerge – violently vying for power – you become the sole defender of humanity’s last standing government. Only you can create the ultimate squad and save humanity in this turn based, tactical RPG with roguelike elements.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore a sunken world and build your own story <br></li><li> Familiar tactical options with a few new twists including action refunds, stealth positioning and ambushes<br></li><li> Create the ultimate squad from 10 different character classes including the brand new SABOTEUR<br></li><li> Outfit your team with 115 different weapons, armor, and items<br></li><li> Fight 30+ unique enemies from 5 factions<br></li><li> Position your team and then get the kill with stealth</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT HAS CHANGED SINCE LAUNCH?</h2> The game had some issues at launch but has had <strong>six</strong> major updates since then to directly address much of the feedback in that initial wave of reviews. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Significantly reduced the game length to make it less of a grind<br></li><li> Stealth and enemy ambushes, plus a new class (Saboteur) to take advantage<br></li><li> Free switching between characters<br></li><li> More maps that require different tactics<br></li><li> Over powered skills and combos were rebalanced<br></li><li> More weapons, effects and death animations<br></li><li> More story cutscenes and a &quot;proper&quot; ending<br></li><li> Refined the existing enemies and created a few new ones<br></li><li> Full controller support<br></li><li> Localization into Spanish, German, Chinese, Japanese<br></li><li> Additional options, including Color Blind mode<br></li><li> Increased turn speed and reduced friction in many of the menus<br></li><li> Casual mode for those that felt the original game was too punishing<br></li><li> Many more changes in direct response to player feedback</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "In a flooded future world rife with violence, rumors of killer machines have spread far and wide. As a number of factions emerge – violently vying for power – you become the sole defender of humanity’s last standing government. Only you can create the ultimate squad and save humanity in this turn based, tactical RPG with roguelike elements.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore a sunken world and build your own story <br></li><li> Familiar tactical options with a few new twists including action refunds, stealth positioning and ambushes<br></li><li> Create the ultimate squad from 10 different character classes including the brand new SABOTEUR<br></li><li> Outfit your team with 115 different weapons, armor, and items<br></li><li> Fight 30+ unique enemies from 5 factions<br></li><li> Position your team and then get the kill with stealth</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT HAS CHANGED SINCE LAUNCH?</h2> The game had some issues at launch but has had <strong>six</strong> major updates since then to directly address much of the feedback in that initial wave of reviews. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Significantly reduced the game length to make it less of a grind<br></li><li> Stealth and enemy ambushes, plus a new class (Saboteur) to take advantage<br></li><li> Free switching between characters<br></li><li> More maps that require different tactics<br></li><li> Over powered skills and combos were rebalanced<br></li><li> More weapons, effects and death animations<br></li><li> More story cutscenes and a &quot;proper&quot; ending<br></li><li> Refined the existing enemies and created a few new ones<br></li><li> Full controller support<br></li><li> Localization into Spanish, German, Chinese, Japanese<br></li><li> Additional options, including Color Blind mode<br></li><li> Increased turn speed and reduced friction in many of the menus<br></li><li> Casual mode for those that felt the original game was too punishing<br></li><li> Many more changes in direct response to player feedback</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Explore a flooded world and save humanity from a terrible threat in this turn based, tactical RPG with roguelike elements",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês<strong>*</strong>, Alemão, Japonês, Espanhol (Espanha), Chinês simplificado, Espanhol (América Latina), Islandês<br><strong>*</strong>idiomas com suporte total de áudio",
